{"id":73952,"title":"170 | 生产扩展环节","content":"将微服务架构从概念验证（POC）推向生产环境，需在安全、监控、前后端分离及组织架构四个维度进行深度扩展。安全方面，必须实施网段隔离与防火墙策略，限制外部对后台敏感 API 的访问，确保服务间调用安全。监控层面，应消除业务代码侵入性，由框架团队统一封装监控埋点为 Spring Boot Starter；同时补齐网关及多语言服务的监控盲区，利用 CAT 3.0 等多语言客户端实现全链路追踪，并完善 Prometheus 指标采集与告警规则。针对前后端分离场景，传统依赖 Nginx 由运维配置路由的方式效率较低，建议引入 Edge Proxy（如 Traefik）构建自助式路由平台，支持开发人员自主配置 API 转发与静态资源分发，提升交付效率。最关键的是，微服务落地本质是组织架构变革。企业应参照“中台战略”重构团队：底层设立独立团队负责基础设施与基础框架（技术中台），中间层专注核心业务领域服务（业务中台），上层聚焦前端应用接入。通过职责分层与单一化，避免角色混淆，以匹配的组织形态支撑技术架构的高效运行。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":78128,"user_name":"愤怒的小猥琐","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1451780,"ip_address":"","ucode":"E3BB1B0542D490","user_header":"http://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTJv3HPde36ll9u5EpEIJyR9jMXE0K7pcuxOlf4HUcbs0po9nkicR0mbXlF1Vdoytj1vxSRCZJGOH7Q/132","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1553075403,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":29011,"content":"你好，在微服务模式下，不太建议一个服务同时跨库关联查询。建议逻辑上分两层，底层基础服务，每个服务仅维护各自的数据源，上层是聚合服务，它可以通过查询底层基础服务再进行聚合的方式获得想要的数据视图，这样可以避免跨库查询。当然中间可以增加缓存(caching)等机制，经一步优化跨服务聚合查询。","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"杨波","uid":1030344,"ctime":1553519200,"ip_address":"","comment_id":78128,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100007001,"comment_content":"杨波老师你好,微服务架构数据库都在不同的微服务模块里,那么它们之间的表关联查询该怎么做呢?使用微服务的调用方式调用吗?还是配成多数据源的方式去调用?","like_count":2,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1030344,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/b8/c8/c94d38a7.jpg","nickname":"杨波","note":"","ucode":"FA3418BB703BCA","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":443978,"discussion_content":"你好，在微服务模式下，不太建议一个服务同时跨库关联查询。建议逻辑上分两层，底层基础服务，每个服务仅维护各自的数据源，上层是聚合服务，它可以通过查询底层基础服务再进行聚合的方式获得想要的数据视图，这样可以避免跨库查询。当然中间可以增加缓存(caching)等机制，经一步优化跨服务聚合查询。","content_length":144,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1553519200,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":56550,"user_name":"王盛武","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1182516,"ip_address":"","ucode":"DE7EF246D3DCE8","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/0b/34/f41d73a4.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1546486625,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":20558,"content":"对，视频中案例内网使用nginx集中式负载均衡，zuul直接使用域名通过nginx间接访问服务，没有用eureka&#47;ribbon做软负载，如果改造成使用eureka&#47;ribbon软负载在架构上也ok。","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"杨波","uid":1030344,"ctime":1546605129,"ip_address":"","comment_id":56550,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100007001,"comment_content":"波波老师，请教个问题：\n架构H5V1.0里，如果使用了内网域名， 那zuul和微服务之间的负载均衡，是通过内网nginx，\n那么zuul里的ribbon组件就不用开启了吧？","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1030344,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/b8/c8/c94d38a7.jpg","nickname":"杨波","note":"","ucode":"FA3418BB703BCA","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":435112,"discussion_content":"对，视频中案例内网使用nginx集中式负载均衡，zuul直接使用域名通过nginx间接访问服务，没有用eureka/ribbon做软负载，如果改造成使用eureka/ribbon软负载在架构上也ok。","content_length":100,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1546605129,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":56544,"user_name":"王盛武","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1182516,"ip_address":"","ucode":"DE7EF246D3DCE8","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/0b/34/f41d73a4.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1546485251,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":20559,"content":"对，edge proxy同时承担反向代理和网关职责，包括令牌校验，过滤器实现机制可能和zuul不同，但原理相通。","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"杨波","uid":1030344,"ctime":1546605292,"ip_address":"","comment_id":56544,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100007001,"comment_content":"H5架构V2.0里\nFilter管理和token校验在哪里做？  Edge Proxy？","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1030344,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/b8/c8/c94d38a7.jpg","nickname":"杨波","note":"","ucode":"FA3418BB703BCA","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":435107,"discussion_content":"对，edge proxy同时承担反向代理和网关职责，包括令牌校验，过滤器实现机制可能和zuul不同，但原理相通。","content_length":56,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1546605292,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]}]}